 nemo_ctl: Control prints
 ~~~~~~~~
    Namelist namctl
                               sn_cfctl%l_runstat =  F
                               sn_cfctl%l_trcstat =  F
                               sn_cfctl%l_obsstat =  F
                               sn_cfctl%l_oceout  =  F
                               sn_cfctl%l_layout  =  F
                               sn_cfctl%l_prtctl  =  F
                               sn_cfctl%l_prttrc  =  F
                               sn_cfctl%l_oasout  =  F
                               sn_cfctl%procmin   =            0
                               sn_cfctl%procmax   =      1000000
                               sn_cfctl%procincr  =            1
                               sn_cfctl%ptimincr  =            1
       timing by routine               ln_timing  =  F
       CFL diagnostics                 ln_diacfl  =  F
       North Pole Folding check        nn_npfchk  =            0
                nn_npfchk = 0: no check             
                            1: verbose checking     
                            2: stop if NPF mismatch 

    Namelist namcfg
       read domain configuration file                ln_read_cfg      =  T
          filename to be read                           cn_domcfg     = ORCA_R2_zps_domcfg
          keep closed seas in the domain (if exist)     ln_closea     =  F
       create a configuration definition file        ln_write_cfg     =  F
          filename to be written                        cn_domcfg_out = domain_cfg_out

