 eos_init : equation of state
 ~~~~~~~~
    Namelist nameos : Chosen the Equation Of Seawater (EOS)
       TEOS-10 : rho=F(Conservative Temperature, Absolute  Salinity, depth)   ln_TEOS10 =  F
       EOS-80  : rho=F(Potential    Temperature, Practical Salinity, depth)   ln_EOS80  =  T
       S-EOS   : rho=F(Conservative Temperature, Absolute  Salinity, depth)   ln_SEOS   =  F

    ==>>>   use of EOS-80 equation of state (pot. temp. and pract. salinity)

    ==>>>   model does not use Conservative Temperature

    Associated physical constant
       volumic mass of reference           rho0  =    1026.0000000000000       kg/m^3
       1. / rho0                        r1_rho0  =    9.7465886939571145E-004  m^3/kg
       ocean specific heat                 rcp   =    3991.8679571196299       J/Kelvin
       rho0 * rcp                       rho0_rcp =    4095656.5240047402     
       1. / ( rho0 * rcp )           r1_rho0_rcp =    2.4416109948160356E-007

